        "## Manual Assessment and Documentation\n",
        "\n",
        "### Subtask:\n",
        "Manually review the displayed original transcripts and their corresponding extracted topics. Assess the quality of the extraction in terms of precision (are the extracted topics truly present?) and recall (did the LLM miss any major topics?). Document any observed limitations or systematic errors in the extraction process based on this manual review.\n"
      ]
